{"channelId":"UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","row":["Dog Haven",104000,"Welcome to dog haven, your go-to source for heartwarming and inspiring dog rescue stories! 🐾 Here, we’re dedicated to rescuing abandoned, abused, and neglected dogs, giving them a second chance at life and showing the world the incredible bond between humans and dogs.\n\nOur channel features real-life rescues, rehabilitation journeys, adoption success stories, and tips for dog lovers on how to make a difference in the lives of animals. Whether you're an animal advocate or simply a dog lover, you'll find touching stories, educational content, and behind-the-scenes footage of the incredible transformations of these beautiful animals.\n\nJoin us on our mission to spread compassion, save lives, and raise awareness about animal welfare. Every like, share, and subscription helps us continue our work in giving these lovable dogs the happy, safe homes they deserve!\n\nTogether, we can make the world a better place for our furry friends.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:04.226Z","channelId":"UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"161f2af9d76eb39534454ea0c7f50bf861369203021f3f0a62bbd59ad7408ecf","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b54ad1d58f11c2dc027d6eb769afa6b3c39a7156be6d21da90f0062885a520ed"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:04.226Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":104000,"raw":"104K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt0o5nBHBAChz5A_iyobbEw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:04.226Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal r